Subject: [PATCH 387/443] [ae-patch] Archiving a session archives its side
 chats too, and Undo restores only the ones it archived

Side chats are hidden from the session list, so archiving the parent left them running and still counted as working. The session PATCH route now walks the side chats (nested ones included, depth capped at 8), archives each, defers its runner teardown like the parent's, and marks it with ae.side_chat.archived_with. Undo restores exactly the marked ones, so a side chat archived by hand stays archived. Logic lives in the new ae_side_chat_archive.py; routes_core.py gains the call sites.
